---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Contact">
    <h1>Contact</h1>

    <p class="intro">If something on this site resonates—particularly around pricing, growth, or commercial execution in complex organizations—I'm always open to a thoughtful conversation.</p>

    <p class="intro">I tend to be most helpful in moments where the direction feels clear but execution feels fragile, or where leadership teams are navigating structural or operating inflection points.</p>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <section>
        <h2>When it makes sense to reach out</h2>

        <div class="situation-list">
            <p class="situation-item">You're evaluating how to scale pricing or commercial discipline across multiple divisions or teams.</p>

            <p class="situation-item">You're preparing for a structural change—new pricing model, acquisition, leadership transition—and want to pressure-test the operating implications.</p>

            <p class="situation-item">You're seeking a senior perspective on a growth or margin challenge that cuts across functions.</p>
        </div>

        <p class="disclaimer">If you're looking for tactical pricing support or one-off analysis, I'm probably not the right fit.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <section>
        <h2>How to reach me</h2>

        <p>The easiest way to connect is via <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/danielfrancisalmeida" class="contact-link">LinkedIn</a>.</p>

        <p>Alternatively, you can email me directly at: <a href="mailto:daniel.almeida@wyngrove.com" class="contact-link">daniel.almeida@wyngrove.com</a></p>
    </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
    .intro {
        font-size: 19px;
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        line-height: 1.7;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
        max-width: 620px;
    }

    .intro:last-of-type {
        margin-bottom: 72px;
    }

    .situation-list {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 20px;
        margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .situation-item {
        line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .disclaimer {
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        font-style: italic;
        margin-top: 32px;
    }

    .contact-link {
        color: var(--text-primary);
        text-decoration: none;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .contact-link:hover {
        border-bottom-color: var(--accent);
    }

    .note {
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        font-style: italic;
        margin-top: 32px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .intro:last-of-type {
            margin-bottom: 56px;
        }
    }
</style>